X:1
T:Angels We Have Heard On High
T:GLORIA
C:Music: French carol melody · Words: French Carol; Translated by James Chadwick, 1862
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Lutheran Worship' Hymnal, 1982 Hymn 55. "Carols Old And Carols New", 1916 Carol 181.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/gloria_french) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=130
K:F
